{"version":2,"exportedAt":1772631949781,"story":{"title":"The Sparkle-Horn Snort!","userPrompt":"to say magical unicorn","authorStyleId":"roald-dahl","readingLevel":"emerging","illustrationStyleId":"colored_pencil","pages":[{"pageNumber":1,"text":"Barnaby Bumble was a boy. He loved to draw, he did! But his art was a… mess. A BIG mess!","illustrationPrompt":"Barnaby, a small boy with messy brown hair and oversized glasses, stands surrounded by chaotic drawings of blobs and scribbles. His face is scrunched in frustration. Background is a colorful, messy bedroom. Style: Whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful. Colors: Bright, warm, whimsical.","imageMeta":{"provider":"gemini","generatedAt":1770330874851,"durationMs":4949,"retries":0,"promptLength":946,"success":true,"prompt":"colored pencil illustration, crayon drawing style, hand-drawn texture, warm sketchy lines, child-like artistic charm, textured coloring A 7-year-old boy with fair skin with a light dusting of freckles, with short messy sandy blond hair in unruly, sticking up in various directions, big-expressive bright cerulean blue eyes with frustrated expression, wearing A slightly oversized bright yellow t-shirt with a printed bumblebee and blue overalls with one strap undone. Barefoot., with A smear of blue crayon on his cheek, gap-toothed smile, freckles across his nose, a small bandage on his left knee, always covered in art supplies. Barnaby Bumble standing amidst a chaotic art mess. Paper scraps, paint splatters, and crumpled drawings surround him. in A sunny meadow near Barnaby's house, specifically a cluttered area where he draws, perhaps with his house visible in the background.. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles."}},{"pageNumber":2,"text":"One day, he met a… Horn-Horse! A big, white horse with a horn so bright. It gave a little… snort!","illustrationPrompt":"A large, friendly-looking white Horn-Horse with a swirling, rainbow-colored horn stands in a sunny meadow. The Horn-Horse has a gentle smile and is emitting a small puff of sparkly smoke from its nostrils (the snort!). Style: Whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful. Colors: Pastel, warm, whimsical.","imageMeta":{"provider":"gemini","generatedAt":1770330879071,"durationMs":9168,"retries":0,"promptLength":1150,"success":true,"prompt":"colored pencil illustration, crayon drawing style, hand-drawn texture, warm sketchy lines, child-like artistic charm, textured coloring A 7-year-old boy with fair skin with a light dusting of freckles, with short messy sandy blond hair in unruly, sticking up in various directions, big-expressive bright cerulean blue eyes with amazed expression, wearing A slightly oversized bright yellow t-shirt with a printed bumblebee and blue overalls with one strap undone. Barefoot., with A smear of blue crayon on his cheek, gap-toothed smile, freckles across his nose, a small bandage on his left knee, always covered in art supplies. A large pure white fur with a subtle shimmer horse, large warm honey brown eyes with calm expression, a single, spiraling horn that glows with a soft, internal light, long, flowing white mane and tail, feathery wings that are usually folded, sparkling hooves, slim build. Barnaby Bumble meeting the Horn-Horse for the first time. Barnaby is looking up at the Horn-Horse in awe. in A sunny meadow near Barnaby's house; a grassy area where the Horn-Horse appears.. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles."}},{"pageNumber":3,"text":"\"My art is drab!\" said Barnaby. The Horn-Horse winked. \"It needs… MAGIC!\" it said with glee.","illustrationPrompt":"Barnaby, looking up at the Horn-Horse with a worried expression. The Horn-Horse is winking playfully, its horn glowing slightly. Background is the sunny meadow. Style: Whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful. Colors: Bright, warm, whimsical.","imageMeta":{"provider":"gemini","generatedAt":1770330875138,"durationMs":5235,"retries":0,"promptLength":1138,"success":true,"prompt":"colored pencil illustration, crayon drawing style, hand-drawn texture, warm sketchy lines, child-like artistic charm, textured coloring A 7-year-old boy with fair skin with a light dusting of freckles, with short messy sandy blond hair in unruly, sticking up in various directions, big-expressive bright cerulean blue eyes with sad expression, wearing A slightly oversized bright yellow t-shirt with a printed bumblebee and blue overalls with one strap undone. Barefoot., with A smear of blue crayon on his cheek, gap-toothed smile, freckles across his nose, a small bandage on his left knee, always covered in art supplies. A large pure white fur with a subtle shimmer horse, large warm honey brown eyes with mischievous expression, a single, spiraling horn that glows with a soft, internal light, long, flowing white mane and tail, feathery wings that are usually folded, sparkling hooves, slim build. Barnaby Bumble sadly showing a drab drawing to the Horn-Horse. The Horn-Horse winks mischievously. in A sunny meadow near Barnaby's house; close to where they met initially.. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles."}},{"pageNumber":4,"text":"The Horn-Horse gave a HUGE snort. Rainbow dust rained down! Barnaby’s art! It sprang to LIFE!","illustrationPrompt":"The Horn-Horse is snorting a massive cloud of rainbow-colored dust. Barnaby is caught in the dust cloud, looking surprised but delighted. His drawings are now floating in the air, glowing with color. Style: Whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful. Colors: Vibrant, warm, whimsical.","imageMeta":{"provider":"gemini","generatedAt":1770330879359,"durationMs":4507,"retries":0,"promptLength":1139,"success":true,"prompt":"colored pencil illustration, crayon drawing style, hand-drawn texture, warm sketchy lines, child-like artistic charm, textured coloring A 7-year-old boy with fair skin with a light dusting of freckles, with short messy sandy blond hair in unruly, sticking up in various directions, big-expressive bright cerulean blue eyes with surprised expression, wearing A slightly oversized bright yellow t-shirt with a printed bumblebee and blue overalls with one strap undone. Barefoot., with A smear of blue crayon on his cheek, gap-toothed smile, freckles across his nose, a small bandage on his left knee, always covered in art supplies. A large pure white fur with a subtle shimmer horse, large warm honey brown eyes with excited expression, a single, spiraling horn that glows with a soft, internal light, long, flowing white mane and tail, feathery wings that are usually folded, sparkling hooves, slim build. The Horn-Horse giving a huge snort, with rainbow dust raining down on Barnaby's art. The art is starting to glow. in A sunny meadow near Barnaby's house; the same location.. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles."}},{"pageNumber":5,"text":"Blobs turned to birds! Scribbles to stars! Barnaby giggled. \"WOW!\" he said. \"It’s not a mess!\"","illustrationPrompt":"Barnaby is surrounded by his transformed artwork: colorful bird drawings are flying, star drawings are twinkling. He is laughing joyfully, his glasses slightly askew. Style: Whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful. Colors: Bright, warm, whimsical.","imageMeta":{"provider":"gemini","generatedAt":1770330881344,"durationMs":6206,"retries":0,"promptLength":873,"success":true,"prompt":"colored pencil illustration, crayon drawing style, hand-drawn texture, warm sketchy lines, child-like artistic charm, textured coloring A 7-year-old boy with fair skin with a light dusting of freckles, with short messy sandy blond hair in unruly, sticking up in various directions, big-expressive bright cerulean blue eyes with joyful expression, wearing A slightly oversized bright yellow t-shirt with a printed bumblebee and blue overalls with one strap undone. Barefoot., with A smear of blue crayon on h